{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>中國地震台網正式測定：11月21日下午6時45分在青海海西州德令哈市（北緯37.14度，東經96.62度）發生5.6級地震，震源深度10千米。</p><figure><img alt=\"中國地震台網正式測定：11月21日18時45分在青海海西州德令哈市（北緯37.14度，東經96.62度）發生5.6級地震，震源深度10千米。（中國地震台網中心）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261121/1200886885015097344694015.jpeg/e2GL5qwocEO5FP2lJcglD8TsAFCkaJAD_zlM8P85TPA\"/><figcaption>中國地震台網正式測定：11月21日18時45分在青海海西州德令哈市（北緯37.14度，東經96.62度）發生5.6級地震，震源深度10千米。（中國地震台網中心）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T11:23:51.901088+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":152,"images":1,"source":"HK01 中國","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T11:00:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T13:37:26.892116+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T11:17:22.087712+00:00","content_hash":"7890b7091322ec37c2aa495e6a88b89253d16b9d76ba7d4b32b398fbf76cbfc5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}